  "critique": {
    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The strongest distinctive idea is the cyan-to-red mandate chain paired with the widening intent-versus-outcome divergence graphic; it makes semantic mismatch visually legible across all three viewports. The oversized editorial headline and restrained terminal palette reinforce the identity. However, tablet/mobile reduce the chain to conventional stacked cards, and the desktop’s large empty panel plus familiar verification rows make the composition feel partly like a generic security dashboard rather than a singular demo moment.",
